{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>בעברת.</b> נעתם; in the language of Kedar, like חשך — this too is joined on account of the smoke mentioned above. And R. Moses the Kohen said that it is like יועם זהב (Lamentations 4:1) and the tav is of the hithpa'el binyan, and this is a great error."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:04.162584536Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}